IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sgta-nouns`

-- Telecommunications Act 1999 (Singapore), 2020 Revised Edition, informal consolidation (TA1999.txt).
-- PART 5A CONTROL OF DESIGNATED TELECOMMUNICATION LICENSEES, DESIGNATED BUSINESS TRUSTS AND DESIGNATED TRUSTS: s 37 (interpretation of this Part).
-- Seat: the person who holds or controls a stake (am I a 12% or a 30% controller; who is my associate; which of my interests count).
-- A definition by cross-reference (Companies Act, Business Trusts Act) takes that Act's meaning as an input.  A percentage is a number in 0 to 100.
-- The Part-5A dispatch (ss 38 to 43) is in sgta-part5a-s38-43.l4.  2000 Revised Edition: s 37 was s 32A.

§ `s 37(1): the 12% and 30% controllers`

-- src:2795 | 37.—(1) In this Part, unless the context otherwise requires —
-- src:2797 | “12% controller” means —
-- src:2799 | (a) in relation to a designated telecommunication
-- src:2800 | licensee, a person who, alone or together with the
-- src:2801 | person’s associates —
-- src:2803 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:2804 | 57 Telecommunications Act 1999 2020 Ed.
-- src:2806 | (i) holds 12% or more but less than 30% of the
-- src:2807 | total number of voting shares in the designated
-- src:2808 | telecommunication licensee; or
-- src:2810 | (ii) is in a position to control 12% or more but less
-- src:2811 | than 30% of the voting power in the designated
-- src:2812 | telecommunication licensee;
-- src:2814 | (b) in relation to a designated business trust, a person
-- src:2815 | who, alone or together with the person’s associates —
-- src:2817 | (i) holds 12% or more but less than 30% of the
-- src:2818 | total number of units in the designated business
-- src:2819 | trust; or
-- src:2821 | (ii) is in a position to control 12% or more but less
-- src:2822 | than 30% of the voting power in the designated
-- src:2823 | business trust; or
-- src:2825 | (c) in relation to a designated trust, a person who, alone
-- src:2826 | or together with the person’s associates —
-- src:2828 | (i) holds 12% or more but less than 30% of the
-- src:2829 | equity interests in the designated trust; or
-- src:2831 | (ii) is in a position to control 12% or more but less
-- src:2832 | than 30% of the voting power in the designated
-- src:2833 | trust;
@ref s 37(1) "12% controller" (src:2795-2833)
GIVEN `percentage of the total number of voting shares in the designated telecommunication licensee held, alone or together with associates` IS A NUMBER
      `percentage of the voting power in the designated telecommunication licensee the person is in a position to control, alone or together with associates` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1) "12% controller" (a): the person is a 12% controller of the designated telecommunication licensee` MEANS
        ((`percentage of the total number of voting shares in the designated telecommunication licensee held, alone or together with associates` AT LEAST 12) AND (`percentage of the total number of voting shares in the designated telecommunication licensee held, alone or together with associates` LESS THAN 30))
    OR ((`percentage of the voting power in the designated telecommunication licensee the person is in a position to control, alone or together with associates` AT LEAST 12) AND (`percentage of the voting power in the designated telecommunication licensee the person is in a position to control, alone or together with associates` LESS THAN 30))

GIVEN `percentage of the total number of units in the designated business trust held, alone or together with associates` IS A NUMBER
      `percentage of the voting power in the designated business trust the person is in a position to control, alone or together with associates` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1) "12% controller" (b): the person is a 12% controller of the designated business trust` MEANS
        ((`percentage of the total number of units in the designated business trust held, alone or together with associates` AT LEAST 12) AND (`percentage of the total number of units in the designated business trust held, alone or together with associates` LESS THAN 30))
    OR ((`percentage of the voting power in the designated business trust the person is in a position to control, alone or together with associates` AT LEAST 12) AND (`percentage of the voting power in the designated business trust the person is in a position to control, alone or together with associates` LESS THAN 30))

GIVEN `percentage of the equity interests in the designated trust held, alone or together with associates` IS A NUMBER
      `percentage of the voting power in the designated trust the person is in a position to control, alone or together with associates` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1) "12% controller" (c): the person is a 12% controller of the designated trust` MEANS
        ((`percentage of the equity interests in the designated trust held, alone or together with associates` AT LEAST 12) AND (`percentage of the equity interests in the designated trust held, alone or together with associates` LESS THAN 30))
    OR ((`percentage of the voting power in the designated trust the person is in a position to control, alone or together with associates` AT LEAST 12) AND (`percentage of the voting power in the designated trust the person is in a position to control, alone or together with associates` LESS THAN 30))

-- src:2835 | “30% controller” means —
-- src:2837 | (a) in relation to a designated telecommunication
-- src:2838 | licensee, a person who, alone or together with the
-- src:2839 | person’s associates —
-- src:2841 | (i) holds 30% or more of the total number of
-- src:2842 | voting shares in the designated
-- src:2843 | telecommunication licensee; or
-- src:2845 | (ii) is in a position to control 30% or more of the
-- src:2846 | voting power in the designated
-- src:2847 | telecommunication licensee;
-- src:2849 | (b) in relation to a designated business trust, a person
-- src:2850 | who, alone or together with the person’s associates —
-- src:2852 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:2853 | 2020 Ed. Telecommunications Act 1999 58
-- src:2855 | (i) holds 30% or more of the total number of units
-- src:2856 | in the designated business trust; or
-- src:2858 | (ii) is in a position to control 30% or more of the
-- src:2859 | voting power in the designated business trust;
-- src:2860 | or
-- src:2862 | (c) in relation to a designated trust, a person who, alone
-- src:2863 | or together with the person’s associates —
-- src:2865 | (i) holds 30% or more of the equity interests in the
-- src:2866 | designated trust; or
-- src:2868 | (ii) is in a position to control 30% or more of the
-- src:2869 | voting power in the designated trust;
@ref s 37(1) "30% controller" (src:2835-2869)
GIVEN `percentage of the total number of voting shares in the designated telecommunication licensee held, alone or together with associates` IS A NUMBER
      `percentage of the voting power in the designated telecommunication licensee the person is in a position to control, alone or together with associates` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1) "30% controller" (a): the person is a 30% controller of the designated telecommunication licensee` MEANS
    (`percentage of the total number of voting shares in the designated telecommunication licensee held, alone or together with associates` AT LEAST 30) OR (`percentage of the voting power in the designated telecommunication licensee the person is in a position to control, alone or together with associates` AT LEAST 30)

GIVEN `percentage of the total number of units in the designated business trust held, alone or together with associates` IS A NUMBER
      `percentage of the voting power in the designated business trust the person is in a position to control, alone or together with associates` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1) "30% controller" (b): the person is a 30% controller of the designated business trust` MEANS
    (`percentage of the total number of units in the designated business trust held, alone or together with associates` AT LEAST 30) OR (`percentage of the voting power in the designated business trust the person is in a position to control, alone or together with associates` AT LEAST 30)

GIVEN `percentage of the equity interests in the designated trust held, alone or together with associates` IS A NUMBER
      `percentage of the voting power in the designated trust the person is in a position to control, alone or together with associates` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1) "30% controller" (c): the person is a 30% controller of the designated trust` MEANS
    (`percentage of the equity interests in the designated trust held, alone or together with associates` AT LEAST 30) OR (`percentage of the voting power in the designated trust the person is in a position to control, alone or together with associates` AT LEAST 30)

§ `s 37(1): the other definitions`

-- src:2871 | “business” means —
-- src:2873 | (a) in relation to a designated business trust, the business
-- src:2874 | relating to the trust property of the designated
-- src:2875 | business trust and managed and operated by the
-- src:2876 | trustee‑manager of the designated business trust in its
-- src:2877 | capacity as trustee‑manager of the designated
-- src:2878 | business trust; or
-- src:2880 | (b) in relation to a designated trust, such business
-- src:2881 | relating to the trust property of the designated trust
-- src:2882 | as is prescribed by any regulations made under
-- src:2883 | section 97;
@ref s 37(1) "business" (src:2871-2883)
GIVEN `it is the business relating to the trust property of the designated business trust and managed and operated by the trustee-manager in its capacity as trustee-manager` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1) "business" (a): this is the "business" of the designated business trust` MEANS
    `it is the business relating to the trust property of the designated business trust and managed and operated by the trustee-manager in its capacity as trustee-manager`

GIVEN `it is such business relating to the trust property of the designated trust as is prescribed by regulations made under section 97` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1) "business" (b): this is the "business" of the designated trust` MEANS
    `it is such business relating to the trust property of the designated trust as is prescribed by regulations made under section 97`

-- src:2885 | “business trust” has the meaning given by section 2 of the
-- src:2886 | Business Trusts Act 2004;
-- src:2888 | “corporation” has the meaning given by section 4(1) of the
-- src:2889 | Companies Act 1967;
@ref s 37(1) "business trust" and "corporation" (src:2885-2889)
GIVEN `it has the meaning section 2 of the Business Trusts Act 2004 gives business trust` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1): this is a "business trust"` MEANS
    `it has the meaning section 2 of the Business Trusts Act 2004 gives business trust`

GIVEN `it has the meaning section 4(1) of the Companies Act 1967 gives corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1): this is a "corporation"` MEANS
    `it has the meaning section 4(1) of the Companies Act 1967 gives corporation`

-- src:2891 | “designated business trust” means a business trust that —
-- src:2893 | (a) is established wholly or partly in respect of a
-- src:2894 | telecommunication system (or any part of it)
-- src:2895 | operated by a telecommunication system licensee;
-- src:2896 | and
-- src:2898 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:2899 | 59 Telecommunications Act 1999 2020 Ed.
-- src:2901 | (b) has been declared by the Authority under
-- src:2902 | subsection (2) to be a designated business trust for
-- src:2903 | the purposes of this Part;
@ref s 37(1) "designated business trust" (src:2891-2903)
GIVEN `it is a business trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is established wholly or partly in respect of a telecommunication system, or any part of it, operated by a telecommunication system licensee` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority has declared it under subsection (2) to be a designated business trust for the purposes of this Part` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1): this is a "designated business trust"` MEANS
    `it is a business trust` AND `it is established wholly or partly in respect of a telecommunication system, or any part of it, operated by a telecommunication system licensee` AND `the Authority has declared it under subsection (2) to be a designated business trust for the purposes of this Part`

-- src:2905 | “designated telecommunication licensee” means a
-- src:2906 | telecommunication licensee that is a corporation and that —
-- src:2908 | (a) has been declared by the Authority under
-- src:2909 | subsection (2) to be a designated
-- src:2910 | telecommunication licensee for the purposes of this
-- src:2911 | Part; or
-- src:2913 | (b) belongs to a class of telecommunication licensees
-- src:2914 | which has been declared by the Authority under
-- src:2915 | subsection (2) to be a class of designated
-- src:2916 | telecommunication licensees for the purposes of
-- src:2917 | this Part;
@ref s 37(1) "designated telecommunication licensee" (src:2905-2917)
GIVEN `it is a telecommunication licensee that is a corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority has declared it under subsection (2) to be a designated telecommunication licensee for the purposes of this Part` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it belongs to a class of telecommunication licensees the Authority has declared under subsection (2) to be a class of designated telecommunication licensees for the purposes of this Part` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1): this is a "designated telecommunication licensee"` MEANS
    `it is a telecommunication licensee that is a corporation` AND (`the Authority has declared it under subsection (2) to be a designated telecommunication licensee for the purposes of this Part` OR `it belongs to a class of telecommunication licensees the Authority has declared under subsection (2) to be a class of designated telecommunication licensees for the purposes of this Part`)

-- src:2919 | “designated trust” means a trust that —
-- src:2921 | (a) is prescribed, or belongs to a class of trusts
-- src:2922 | prescribed, by any regulations made under
-- src:2923 | section 97;
-- src:2925 | (b) is established wholly or partly in respect of a
-- src:2926 | telecommunication system (or any part of it)
-- src:2927 | operated by a telecommunication system licensee;
-- src:2928 | and
-- src:2930 | (c) has been declared by the Authority under
-- src:2931 | subsection (2) to be a designated trust for the
-- src:2932 | purposes of this Part;
@ref s 37(1) "designated trust" (src:2919-2932)
GIVEN `it is prescribed, or belongs to a class of trusts prescribed, by regulations made under section 97` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is established wholly or partly in respect of a telecommunication system, or any part of it, operated by a telecommunication system licensee` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority has declared it under subsection (2) to be a designated trust for the purposes of this Part` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1): this is a "designated trust"` MEANS
    `it is prescribed, or belongs to a class of trusts prescribed, by regulations made under section 97` AND `it is established wholly or partly in respect of a telecommunication system, or any part of it, operated by a telecommunication system licensee` AND `the Authority has declared it under subsection (2) to be a designated trust for the purposes of this Part`

-- src:2934 | “effective control” means —
-- src:2936 | (a) in relation to a designated telecommunication
-- src:2937 | licensee, the ability to cause the designated
-- src:2938 | telecommunication licensee to take, or to refrain
-- src:2939 | from taking, a major decision regarding the
-- src:2940 | management or operations of the designated
-- src:2941 | telecommunication licensee;
-- src:2943 | (b) in relation to a designated business trust, the ability to
-- src:2944 | cause the trustee‑manager of the designated business
-- src:2946 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:2947 | 2020 Ed. Telecommunications Act 1999 60
-- src:2949 | trust to take, or to refrain from taking, a major
-- src:2950 | decision regarding the management or operations of
-- src:2951 | the designated business trust; or
-- src:2953 | (c) in relation to a designated trust, the ability to cause
-- src:2954 | the trustee of the designated trust to take, or to refrain
-- src:2955 | from taking, a major decision regarding the
-- src:2956 | management or operations of the designated trust;
@ref s 37(1) "effective control" (src:2934-2956)
GIVEN `the person has the ability to cause the designated telecommunication licensee to take, or to refrain from taking, a major decision regarding its management or operations` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1) "effective control" (a): the person has effective control of the designated telecommunication licensee` MEANS
    `the person has the ability to cause the designated telecommunication licensee to take, or to refrain from taking, a major decision regarding its management or operations`

GIVEN `the person has the ability to cause the trustee-manager of the designated business trust to take, or to refrain from taking, a major decision regarding the management or operations of the trust` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1) "effective control" (b): the person has effective control of the designated business trust` MEANS
    `the person has the ability to cause the trustee-manager of the designated business trust to take, or to refrain from taking, a major decision regarding the management or operations of the trust`

GIVEN `the person has the ability to cause the trustee of the designated trust to take, or to refrain from taking, a major decision regarding the management or operations of the trust` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1) "effective control" (c): the person has effective control of the designated trust` MEANS
    `the person has the ability to cause the trustee of the designated trust to take, or to refrain from taking, a major decision regarding the management or operations of the trust`

-- src:2958 | “equity interest” means —
-- src:2960 | (a) in relation to a corporation, a voting share in that
-- src:2961 | corporation;
-- src:2963 | (b) in relation to a designated business trust, a unit in that
-- src:2964 | designated business trust; or
-- src:2966 | (c) in relation to a designated trust, any right or interest,
-- src:2967 | whether legal or equitable, in that designated trust
-- src:2968 | which gives the holder of that right or interest voting
-- src:2969 | power in that designated trust;
@ref s 37(1) "equity interest" (src:2958-2969)
GIVEN `it is a voting share in the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is a unit in the designated business trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it is a right or interest, legal or equitable, in the designated trust which gives the holder voting power in it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1): this is an "equity interest"` MEANS
    `it is a voting share in the corporation` OR `it is a unit in the designated business trust` OR `it is a right or interest, legal or equitable, in the designated trust which gives the holder voting power in it`

-- src:2971 | “related corporation” has the meaning given by section 4(1) of
-- src:2972 | the Companies Act 1967;
-- src:2974 | “relative”, in relation to a person, means —
-- src:2976 | (a) the person’s spouse;
-- src:2978 | (b) a parent or remoter lineal ancestor, or a step‑parent,
-- src:2979 | of the person;
-- src:2981 | (c) a child or remoter issue, or a stepchild, of the person;
-- src:2982 | or
-- src:2984 | (d) a sibling or stepsibling of the person;
-- src:2986 | “share” has the meaning given by section 4(1) of the Companies
-- src:2987 | Act 1967;
-- src:2989 | “treasury share” has the meaning given by section 4(1) of the
-- src:2990 | Companies Act 1967;
-- src:2992 | “trustee-manager” has the meaning given by section 2 of the
-- src:2993 | Business Trusts Act 2004;
-- src:2995 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:2996 | 61 Telecommunications Act 1999 2020 Ed.
-- src:2998 | “unit” has the meaning given by section 2 of the Business Trusts
-- src:2999 | Act 2004;
-- src:3001 | “unitholder” has the meaning given by section 2 of the Business
-- src:3002 | Trusts Act 2004;
-- src:3004 | “voting share” has the meaning given by section 4(1) of the
-- src:3005 | Companies Act 1967.
@ref s 37(1) "related corporation", "relative" and the cross-referenced terms (src:2971-3005)
GIVEN `it has the meaning section 4(1) of the Companies Act 1967 gives related corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1): this is a "related corporation"` MEANS
    `it has the meaning section 4(1) of the Companies Act 1967 gives related corporation`

GIVEN `the person is the spouse of the first person` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a parent or remoter lineal ancestor, or a step-parent, of the first person` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a child or remoter issue, or a stepchild, of the first person` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a sibling or stepsibling of the first person` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(1): this person is a "relative" of the first person` MEANS
    `the person is the spouse of the first person` OR `the person is a parent or remoter lineal ancestor, or a step-parent, of the first person` OR `the person is a child or remoter issue, or a stepchild, of the first person` OR `the person is a sibling or stepsibling of the first person`

GIVEN term IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
`s 37(1): the Act supplying the meaning of this term` MEANS
    BRANCH IF elem term (LIST "share", "treasury share", "voting share") THEN "section 4(1) of the Companies Act 1967"
           IF elem term (LIST "trustee-manager", "unit", "unitholder") THEN "section 2 of the Business Trusts Act 2004"
           OTHERWISE "not a term this subsection defines by cross-reference"

§ `s 37(2) to (4): declarations, stock, associates`

-- src:3009 | (2) The Authority may, by notification in the Gazette, do one or
-- src:3010 | more of the following:
-- src:3012 | (a) declare any telecommunication licensee to be a designated
-- src:3013 | telecommunication licensee for the purposes of this Part;
-- src:3015 | (b) declare any class of telecommunication licensees to be a
-- src:3016 | class of designated telecommunication licensees for the
-- src:3017 | purposes of this Part;
-- src:3019 | (c) declare any business trust to be a designated business trust
-- src:3020 | for the purposes of this Part, if the business trust is
-- src:3021 | established wholly or partly in respect of a
-- src:3022 | telecommunication system (or any part of it) operated by
-- src:3023 | a telecommunication system licensee;
-- src:3025 | (d) declare any trust to be a designated trust for the purposes of
-- src:3026 | this Part, if the trust —
-- src:3028 | (i) is prescribed, or belongs to a class of trusts
-- src:3029 | prescribed, by any regulations made under
-- src:3030 | section 97; and
-- src:3032 | (ii) is established wholly or partly in respect of a
-- src:3033 | telecommunication system (or any part of it)
-- src:3034 | operated by a telecommunication system licensee;
-- src:3036 | (e) vary or revoke any declaration of a designated
-- src:3037 | telecommunication licensee, a designated business trust
-- src:3038 | or a designated trust;
-- src:3040 | (f) vary or revoke any declaration of a class of designated
-- src:3041 | telecommunication licensees.
@ref s 37(2) (src:3009-3041)
GIVEN `the declaration is by notification in the Gazette` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it declares a telecommunication licensee, or a class of telecommunication licensees, to be designated telecommunication licensees for the purposes of the Part` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it declares a business trust established wholly or partly in respect of a telecommunication system, or part of it, operated by a telecommunication system licensee to be a designated business trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it declares a trust, prescribed or belonging to a prescribed class and established wholly or partly in respect of a telecommunication system, or part of it, operated by a telecommunication system licensee, to be a designated trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it varies or revokes a declaration of a designated telecommunication licensee, a designated business trust, a designated trust, or a class of designated telecommunication licensees` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(2): the Authority may make the declaration` MEANS
    `the declaration is by notification in the Gazette` AND (`it declares a telecommunication licensee, or a class of telecommunication licensees, to be designated telecommunication licensees for the purposes of the Part` OR `it declares a business trust established wholly or partly in respect of a telecommunication system, or part of it, operated by a telecommunication system licensee to be a designated business trust` OR `it declares a trust, prescribed or belonging to a prescribed class and established wholly or partly in respect of a telecommunication system, or part of it, operated by a telecommunication system licensee, to be a designated trust` OR `it varies or revokes a declaration of a designated telecommunication licensee, a designated business trust, a designated trust, or a class of designated telecommunication licensees`)

-- src:3048 | (3) For the purposes of this Part, in relation to a designated
-- src:3049 | telecommunication licensee the whole or any portion of the share
-- src:3050 | capital of which consists of stock, an interest of a person in any such
-- src:3051 | stock is deemed to be an interest in an issued share in the designated
-- src:3052 | telecommunication licensee having the same nominal amount as the
-- src:3053 | amount of that stock and having attached to it the same rights as are
-- src:3054 | attached to that stock.
@ref s 37(3) (src:3048-3054)
GIVEN `the share capital of the designated telecommunication licensee consists wholly or partly of stock` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person has an interest in the stock` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(3): the interest is deemed to be an interest in an issued share having the same nominal amount as the stock and the same rights attached` MEANS
    `the share capital of the designated telecommunication licensee consists wholly or partly of stock` AND `the person has an interest in the stock`

-- src:3058 | (4) For the purposes of this Part, a person, A, is an associate of
-- src:3059 | another person, B, if —
-- src:3061 | (a) A is a relative of B;
-- src:3063 | (b) A is a related corporation of B;
-- src:3065 | (c) A is a corporation whose directors are accustomed or under
-- src:3066 | an obligation, whether formal or informal, to act in
-- src:3067 | accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of
-- src:3068 | B or, where B is a corporation, of the directors of B;
-- src:3070 | (d) B is a corporation whose directors are accustomed or under
-- src:3071 | an obligation, whether formal or informal, to act in
-- src:3072 | accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of
-- src:3073 | A or, where A is a corporation, of the directors of A;
-- src:3075 | (e) A is a person who is accustomed or under an obligation,
-- src:3076 | whether formal or informal, to act in accordance with the
-- src:3077 | directions, instructions or wishes of B or, where B is a
-- src:3078 | corporation, of the directors of B;
-- src:3080 | (f) B is a person who is accustomed or under an obligation,
-- src:3081 | whether formal or informal, to act in accordance with the
-- src:3082 | directions, instructions or wishes of A or, where A is a
-- src:3083 | corporation, of the directors of A;
-- src:3085 | (g) A is a corporation in which B, alone or together with other
-- src:3086 | associates of B as described in paragraphs (b) to (f), is in a
-- src:3087 | position to control at least 12% of the voting power in A;
-- src:3089 | (h) B is a corporation in which A, alone or together with other
-- src:3090 | associates of A as described in paragraphs (b) to (f), is in a
-- src:3091 | position to control at least 12% of the voting power in B;
-- src:3093 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:3094 | 63 Telecommunications Act 1999 2020 Ed.
-- src:3096 | (i) A is a person with whom B has an agreement or
-- src:3097 | arrangement, whether oral or in writing and whether
-- src:3098 | express or implied, to act together with respect to the
-- src:3099 | acquisition, holding or disposal of shares, units or other
-- src:3100 | equity interests in, or with respect to the exercise of their
-- src:3101 | voting power in relation to, a designated
-- src:3102 | telecommunication licensee, a designated business trust
-- src:3103 | or a designated trust; or
-- src:3105 | (j) A is related to B in such other manner as may be prescribed
-- src:3106 | by any regulations made under section 97.
@ref s 37(4) (src:3058-3106)
GIVEN `A is a relative of B` IS A BOOLEAN
      `A is a related corporation of B` IS A BOOLEAN
      `A is a corporation whose directors are accustomed or under an obligation, formal or informal, to act in accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of B or, where B is a corporation, of B's directors` IS A BOOLEAN
      `B is a corporation whose directors are accustomed or under an obligation, formal or informal, to act in accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of A or, where A is a corporation, of A's directors` IS A BOOLEAN
      `A is a person who is accustomed or under an obligation, formal or informal, to act in accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of B or, where B is a corporation, of B's directors` IS A BOOLEAN
      `B is a person who is accustomed or under an obligation, formal or informal, to act in accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of A or, where A is a corporation, of A's directors` IS A BOOLEAN
      `A is a corporation in which B, alone or together with other associates of B described in paragraphs (b) to (f), is in a position to control at least 12% of the voting power` IS A BOOLEAN
      `B is a corporation in which A, alone or together with other associates of A described in paragraphs (b) to (f), is in a position to control at least 12% of the voting power` IS A BOOLEAN
      `A is a person with whom B has an agreement or arrangement, oral or written, express or implied, to act together with respect to the acquisition, holding or disposal of shares, units or other equity interests in, or the exercise of voting power in relation to, a designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `A is related to B in another manner prescribed by regulations made under section 97` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(4): A is an associate of B` MEANS
        `A is a relative of B`
    OR `A is a related corporation of B`
    OR `A is a corporation whose directors are accustomed or under an obligation, formal or informal, to act in accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of B or, where B is a corporation, of B's directors`
    OR `B is a corporation whose directors are accustomed or under an obligation, formal or informal, to act in accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of A or, where A is a corporation, of A's directors`
    OR `A is a person who is accustomed or under an obligation, formal or informal, to act in accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of B or, where B is a corporation, of B's directors`
    OR `B is a person who is accustomed or under an obligation, formal or informal, to act in accordance with the directions, instructions or wishes of A or, where A is a corporation, of A's directors`
    OR `A is a corporation in which B, alone or together with other associates of B described in paragraphs (b) to (f), is in a position to control at least 12% of the voting power`
    OR `B is a corporation in which A, alone or together with other associates of A described in paragraphs (b) to (f), is in a position to control at least 12% of the voting power`
    OR `A is a person with whom B has an agreement or arrangement, oral or written, express or implied, to act together with respect to the acquisition, holding or disposal of shares, units or other equity interests in, or the exercise of voting power in relation to, a designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust`
    OR `A is related to B in another manner prescribed by regulations made under section 97`

§ `s 37(5) to (12): holding and interests`

-- src:3110 | (5) For the purposes of this Part —
-- src:3112 | (a) a person holds a voting share in a corporation if the person
-- src:3113 | has any legal or equitable interest in that share, other than
-- src:3114 | an interest that is to be disregarded under subsection (7);
-- src:3116 | (b) a person holds a unit in a business trust if the person has
-- src:3117 | any legal or equitable interest in that unit, other than an
-- src:3118 | interest that is to be disregarded under subsection (10); and
-- src:3120 | (c) a person holds an equity interest in a trust if the person has
-- src:3121 | any legal or equitable interest in that equity interest, other
-- src:3122 | than an interest that is to be disregarded under
-- src:3123 | subsection (12).
@ref s 37(5) (src:3110-3123)
GIVEN `the person has a legal or equitable interest in the share, other than an interest disregarded under subsection (7)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(5)(a): the person holds a voting share in the corporation` MEANS
    `the person has a legal or equitable interest in the share, other than an interest disregarded under subsection (7)`

GIVEN `the person has a legal or equitable interest in the unit, other than an interest disregarded under subsection (10)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(5)(b): the person holds a unit in the business trust` MEANS
    `the person has a legal or equitable interest in the unit, other than an interest disregarded under subsection (10)`

GIVEN `the person has a legal or equitable interest in the equity interest, other than an interest disregarded under subsection (12)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(5)(c): the person holds an equity interest in the trust` MEANS
    `the person has a legal or equitable interest in the equity interest, other than an interest disregarded under subsection (12)`

-- src:3127 | (6) Except as otherwise provided in subsection (7), for the purposes
-- src:3128 | of this Part, a person is deemed to have an interest in a share, if —
-- src:3130 | (a) the person has entered into a contract to purchase that
-- src:3131 | share; or
-- src:3133 | (b) the person, not being the registered holder of that share, is
-- src:3134 | entitled (otherwise than by reason of the person having
-- src:3135 | been appointed a proxy or representative to vote at a
-- src:3136 | meeting of members of a corporation or of a class of its
-- src:3137 | members) to exercise or control the exercise of a right
-- src:3138 | attached to that share.
@ref s 37(6) (src:3127-3138)
GIVEN `the person has entered into a contract to purchase the share` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person, not being the registered holder, is entitled, otherwise than as a proxy or representative to vote at a meeting, to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to the share` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the interest is disregarded under subsection (7)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(6): the person is deemed to have an interest in the share` MEANS
    (NOT `the interest is disregarded under subsection (7)`) AND (`the person has entered into a contract to purchase the share` OR `the person, not being the registered holder, is entitled, otherwise than as a proxy or representative to vote at a meeting, to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to the share`)

-- src:3145 | (7) For the purposes of subsections (5)(a) and (6), the following are
-- src:3146 | disregarded:
-- src:3148 | (a) an interest in a share of a person who holds the share as
-- src:3149 | bare trustee;
-- src:3151 | (b) an interest in a share of a person whose ordinary business
-- src:3152 | includes the lending of money, if the person holds the
-- src:3153 | interest only by way of security for the purposes of a
-- src:3154 | transaction entered into in the ordinary course of business
-- src:3155 | in connection with the lending of money;
-- src:3157 | (c) an interest in a share of a person whose ordinary business
-- src:3158 | includes the underwriting of securities, if the person holds
-- src:3159 | the interest only as an underwriter or a sub‑underwriter to
-- src:3160 | any offering of shares of a designated telecommunication
-- src:3161 | licensee;
-- src:3163 | (d) an interest in a share held by a person —
-- src:3165 | (i) in the person’s capacity as a liquidator, the Official
-- src:3166 | Receiver, the Official Assignee or the Public Trustee;
-- src:3167 | or
-- src:3169 | (ii) by reason of the person holding such other office as
-- src:3170 | may be prescribed for the purposes of section 7(9)(c)
-- src:3171 | of the Companies Act 1967;
-- src:3173 | (e) an interest of a corporation in its own shares purchased or
-- src:3174 | otherwise acquired in accordance with sections 76B to 76G
-- src:3175 | of the Companies Act 1967 (including treasury shares);
-- src:3177 | (f) such interest in a share as may be prescribed for the
-- src:3178 | purposes of section 7(9)(d) of the Companies Act 1967,
-- src:3179 | being an interest of such person, or of a person belonging
-- src:3180 | to such class of persons, as may be prescribed for the
-- src:3181 | purposes of that provision.
@ref s 37(7) (src:3145-3181)
GIVEN `the person holds the share as bare trustee` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person's ordinary business includes the lending of money and the person holds the interest only by way of security for a transaction in the ordinary course of business in connection with the lending of money` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person's ordinary business includes the underwriting of securities and the person holds the interest only as an underwriter or a sub-underwriter to an offering of shares of a designated telecommunication licensee` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person holds the share as a liquidator, the Official Receiver, the Official Assignee or the Public Trustee, or by reason of holding another office prescribed for section 7(9)(c) of the Companies Act 1967` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the interest is of a corporation in its own shares purchased or otherwise acquired in accordance with sections 76B to 76G of the Companies Act 1967, including treasury shares` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the interest is such as is prescribed for section 7(9)(d) of the Companies Act 1967, of a person or class of persons so prescribed` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(7): the interest in the share is disregarded for the purposes of subsections (5)(a) and (6)` MEANS
    `the person holds the share as bare trustee` OR `the person's ordinary business includes the lending of money and the person holds the interest only by way of security for a transaction in the ordinary course of business in connection with the lending of money` OR `the person's ordinary business includes the underwriting of securities and the person holds the interest only as an underwriter or a sub-underwriter to an offering of shares of a designated telecommunication licensee` OR `the person holds the share as a liquidator, the Official Receiver, the Official Assignee or the Public Trustee, or by reason of holding another office prescribed for section 7(9)(c) of the Companies Act 1967` OR `the interest is of a corporation in its own shares purchased or otherwise acquired in accordance with sections 76B to 76G of the Companies Act 1967, including treasury shares` OR `the interest is such as is prescribed for section 7(9)(d) of the Companies Act 1967, of a person or class of persons so prescribed`

-- src:3185 | (8) Section 7(7), (8) and (10) of the Companies Act 1967 apply in
-- src:3186 | determining whether a person has an interest in a share for the
-- src:3187 | purposes of subsections (5)(a) and (6).
@ref s 37(8) (src:3185-3187)
GIVEN `section 7(7), (8) or (10) of the Companies Act 1967 applies in determining whether a person has an interest in a share for the purposes of subsections (5)(a) and (6)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(8): the Companies Act provision applies` MEANS
    `section 7(7), (8) or (10) of the Companies Act 1967 applies in determining whether a person has an interest in a share for the purposes of subsections (5)(a) and (6)`

-- src:3194 | (9) Except as otherwise provided in subsection (10), for the
-- src:3195 | purposes of this Part, a person is deemed to have an interest in a
-- src:3196 | unit, if —
-- src:3198 | (a) the person has entered into a contract to purchase that unit;
-- src:3199 | or
-- src:3201 | (b) the person, not being the registered holder of that unit, is
-- src:3202 | entitled (otherwise than by reason of the person having
-- src:3203 | been appointed a proxy or representative to vote at a
-- src:3204 | meeting of unitholders of a business trust or of a class of its
-- src:3205 | unitholders) to exercise or control the exercise of a right
-- src:3206 | attached to that unit.
@ref s 37(9) (src:3194-3206)
GIVEN `the person has entered into a contract to purchase the unit` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person, not being the registered holder, is entitled, otherwise than as a proxy or representative to vote at a meeting of unitholders, to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to the unit` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the interest is disregarded under subsection (10)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(9): the person is deemed to have an interest in the unit` MEANS
    (NOT `the interest is disregarded under subsection (10)`) AND (`the person has entered into a contract to purchase the unit` OR `the person, not being the registered holder, is entitled, otherwise than as a proxy or representative to vote at a meeting of unitholders, to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to the unit`)

-- src:3210 | (10) For the purposes of subsections (5)(b) and (9), the following
-- src:3211 | are disregarded:
-- src:3213 | (a) an interest in a unit of a person who holds the unit as bare
-- src:3214 | trustee;
-- src:3216 | (b) an interest in a unit of a person whose ordinary business
-- src:3217 | includes the lending of money, if the person holds the
-- src:3218 | interest only by way of security for the purposes of a
-- src:3219 | transaction entered into in the ordinary course of business
-- src:3220 | in connection with the lending of money;
-- src:3222 | (c) an interest in a unit of a person whose ordinary business
-- src:3223 | includes the underwriting of securities, if the person holds
-- src:3224 | the interest only as an underwriter or a sub‑underwriter to
-- src:3225 | any offering of units of a designated business trust;
-- src:3227 | (d) an interest in a unit held by a person in the person’s
-- src:3228 | capacity as a liquidator, the Official Receiver, the Official
-- src:3229 | Assignee or the Public Trustee.
@ref s 37(10) (src:3210-3229)
GIVEN `the person holds the unit as bare trustee` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person's ordinary business includes the lending of money and the person holds the interest only by way of security for a transaction in the ordinary course of business in connection with the lending of money` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person's ordinary business includes the underwriting of securities and the person holds the interest only as an underwriter or a sub-underwriter to an offering of units of a designated business trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person holds the unit in the person's capacity as a liquidator, the Official Receiver, the Official Assignee or the Public Trustee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(10): the interest in the unit is disregarded for the purposes of subsections (5)(b) and (9)` MEANS
    `the person holds the unit as bare trustee` OR `the person's ordinary business includes the lending of money and the person holds the interest only by way of security for a transaction in the ordinary course of business in connection with the lending of money` OR `the person's ordinary business includes the underwriting of securities and the person holds the interest only as an underwriter or a sub-underwriter to an offering of units of a designated business trust` OR `the person holds the unit in the person's capacity as a liquidator, the Official Receiver, the Official Assignee or the Public Trustee`

-- src:3233 | (11) Except as otherwise provided in subsection (12), for the
-- src:3234 | purposes of this Part, a person is deemed to have an equity interest in
-- src:3235 | a designated trust, if —
-- src:3237 | (a) the person has entered into a contract to purchase that
-- src:3238 | equity interest; or
-- src:3240 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:3241 | 2020 Ed. Telecommunications Act 1999 66
-- src:3243 | (b) the person, not being the holder of that equity interest, is
-- src:3244 | entitled (otherwise than by reason of the person having
-- src:3245 | been appointed a proxy or representative to vote at a
-- src:3246 | meeting of holders of equity interests in the designated
-- src:3247 | trust or of a class of its holders of equity interests) to
-- src:3248 | exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to that
-- src:3249 | equity interest.
@ref s 37(11) (src:3233-3249)
GIVEN `the person has entered into a contract to purchase the equity interest` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person, not being the holder, is entitled, otherwise than as a proxy or representative to vote at a meeting of holders of equity interests, to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to the equity interest` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the interest is disregarded under subsection (12)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(11): the person is deemed to have an equity interest in the designated trust` MEANS
    (NOT `the interest is disregarded under subsection (12)`) AND (`the person has entered into a contract to purchase the equity interest` OR `the person, not being the holder, is entitled, otherwise than as a proxy or representative to vote at a meeting of holders of equity interests, to exercise or control the exercise of a right attached to the equity interest`)

-- src:3253 | (12) For the purposes of subsections (5)(c) and (11), the following
-- src:3254 | are disregarded:
-- src:3256 | (a) an equity interest of a person who holds the interest as bare
-- src:3257 | trustee;
-- src:3259 | (b) an equity interest of a person whose ordinary business
-- src:3260 | includes the lending of money, if the person holds the
-- src:3261 | interest only by way of security for the purposes of a
-- src:3262 | transaction entered into in the ordinary course of business
-- src:3263 | in connection with the lending of money;
-- src:3265 | (c) an equity interest of a person whose ordinary business
-- src:3266 | includes the underwriting of securities, if the person holds
-- src:3267 | the interest only as an underwriter or a sub‑underwriter to
-- src:3268 | any offering of equity interests in a designated trust;
-- src:3270 | (d) an equity interest held by a person in the person’s capacity
-- src:3271 | as a liquidator, the Official Receiver, the Official Assignee
-- src:3272 | or the Public Trustee.
@ref s 37(12) (src:3253-3272)
GIVEN `the person holds the equity interest as bare trustee` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person's ordinary business includes the lending of money and the person holds the interest only by way of security for a transaction in the ordinary course of business in connection with the lending of money` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person's ordinary business includes the underwriting of securities and the person holds the interest only as an underwriter or a sub-underwriter to an offering of equity interests in a designated trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person holds the equity interest in the person's capacity as a liquidator, the Official Receiver, the Official Assignee or the Public Trustee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(12): the equity interest is disregarded for the purposes of subsections (5)(c) and (11)` MEANS
    `the person holds the equity interest as bare trustee` OR `the person's ordinary business includes the lending of money and the person holds the interest only by way of security for a transaction in the ordinary course of business in connection with the lending of money` OR `the person's ordinary business includes the underwriting of securities and the person holds the interest only as an underwriter or a sub-underwriter to an offering of equity interests in a designated trust` OR `the person holds the equity interest in the person's capacity as a liquidator, the Official Receiver, the Official Assignee or the Public Trustee`

§ `s 37(13) to (15): control of voting power`

-- src:3276 | (13) For the purposes of this Part, a reference to control of a
-- src:3277 | percentage of the voting power in a designated telecommunication
-- src:3278 | licensee, designated business trust or designated trust is a reference to
-- src:3279 | control that is direct or indirect, including control that is exercisable
-- src:3280 | as a result of or by means of arrangements or practices, whether or not
-- src:3281 | having legal or equitable force and whether or not based on legal or
-- src:3282 | equitable rights, of that percentage of the total number of votes that
-- src:3283 | may be cast in —
-- src:3285 | (a) a general meeting of the designated telecommunication
-- src:3286 | licensee;
-- src:3288 | [Act 13 of 2026 wef 02/10/2026]
-- src:3290 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:3291 | 67 Telecommunications Act 1999 2020 Ed.
-- src:3293 | (b) in the case of a designated telecommunication licensee,
-- src:3294 | designated business trust or designated trust that is a
-- src:3295 | business trust — a general meeting of the unitholders of the
-- src:3296 | business trust; or
-- src:3298 | [Act 13 of 2026 wef 02/10/2026]
-- src:3300 | (c) in the case of a designated trust, a general meeting of the
-- src:3301 | beneficiaries of the trust in question.
@ref s 37(13) (src:3276-3301)
GIVEN `the control is direct or indirect, including control exercisable as a result of or by means of arrangements or practices, whether or not having legal or equitable force and whether or not based on legal or equitable rights` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the votes are those that may be cast in a general meeting of the designated telecommunication licensee, in a general meeting of the unitholders of the business trust, or in a general meeting of the beneficiaries of the designated trust` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(13): this is control of a percentage of the voting power in the designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust` MEANS
    `the control is direct or indirect, including control exercisable as a result of or by means of arrangements or practices, whether or not having legal or equitable force and whether or not based on legal or equitable rights` AND `the votes are those that may be cast in a general meeting of the designated telecommunication licensee, in a general meeting of the unitholders of the business trust, or in a general meeting of the beneficiaries of the designated trust`

-- src:3309 | (14) For the purposes of subsection (13), any control of any voting
-- src:3310 | power by a person in a designated telecommunication licensee,
-- src:3311 | designated business trust or designated trust is not to be regarded as
-- src:3312 | control of voting power by the person if it is exercisable in the
-- src:3313 | following capacities of the person:
-- src:3315 | (a) by virtue of the person holding an interest in a share of the
-- src:3316 | designated telecommunication licensee, a unit of the
-- src:3317 | designated business trust or an equity interest in the
-- src:3318 | designated trust (as the case may be) as a bare trustee;
-- src:3320 | (b) if the person’s ordinary business includes the lending of
-- src:3321 | money, by virtue of the person holding an interest in a
-- src:3322 | share of the designated telecommunication licensee, a unit
-- src:3323 | of the designated business trust or an equity interest in the
-- src:3324 | designated trust (as the case may be) only by way of
-- src:3325 | security for the purposes of a transaction entered into in the
-- src:3326 | ordinary course of business in connection with the lending
-- src:3327 | of money;
-- src:3329 | (c) if the person’s ordinary business includes the underwriting
-- src:3330 | of securities, by virtue of the person holding an interest in a
-- src:3331 | share of the designated telecommunication licensee, a unit
-- src:3332 | of the designated business trust or an equity interest in the
-- src:3333 | designated trust (as the case may be) only as an underwriter
-- src:3334 | or a sub‑underwriter to any offering of shares of the
-- src:3335 | designated telecommunication licensee, units of the
-- src:3336 | designated business trust or equity interests in the
-- src:3337 | designated trust, as the case may be;
-- src:3339 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:3340 | 2020 Ed. Telecommunications Act 1999 68
-- src:3342 | (d) by virtue of the person having been appointed a proxy or
-- src:3343 | representative to vote at a general meeting mentioned in
-- src:3344 | subsection (13);
-- src:3346 | (e) in the person’s capacity as a liquidator, the Official
-- src:3347 | Receiver, the Official Assignee or the Public Trustee;
-- src:3349 | (f) by reason of the person holding such other office as may be
-- src:3350 | prescribed for the purposes of section 7(9)(c) of the
-- src:3351 | Companies Act 1967.
@ref s 37(14) (src:3309-3351)
GIVEN `the control is exercisable by virtue of the person holding an interest as a bare trustee` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the control is exercisable by a person whose ordinary business includes the lending of money, only by way of security for a transaction entered into in the ordinary course of business in connection with the lending of money` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the control is exercisable by a person whose ordinary business includes the underwriting of securities, only as an underwriter or a sub-underwriter to an offering` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the control is exercisable by virtue of the person having been appointed a proxy or representative to vote at a general meeting mentioned in subsection (13)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the control is exercisable in the person's capacity as a liquidator, the Official Receiver, the Official Assignee or the Public Trustee, or by reason of holding another office prescribed for section 7(9)(c) of the Companies Act 1967` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(14): the control of voting power is regarded as control of voting power by the person` MEANS
    NOT (`the control is exercisable by virtue of the person holding an interest as a bare trustee` OR `the control is exercisable by a person whose ordinary business includes the lending of money, only by way of security for a transaction entered into in the ordinary course of business in connection with the lending of money` OR `the control is exercisable by a person whose ordinary business includes the underwriting of securities, only as an underwriter or a sub-underwriter to an offering` OR `the control is exercisable by virtue of the person having been appointed a proxy or representative to vote at a general meeting mentioned in subsection (13)` OR `the control is exercisable in the person's capacity as a liquidator, the Official Receiver, the Official Assignee or the Public Trustee, or by reason of holding another office prescribed for section 7(9)(c) of the Companies Act 1967`)

-- src:3355 | (15) Where a corporation is limited both by shares and by guarantee
-- src:3356 | or does not have a share capital, this section has effect as if the
-- src:3357 | members of the corporation were shareholders in the corporation.
@ref s 37(15) (src:3355-3357)
GIVEN `the corporation is limited both by shares and by guarantee, or does not have a share capital` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 37(15): section 37 has effect as if the members of the corporation were shareholders in it` MEANS
    `the corporation is limited both by shares and by guarantee, or does not have a share capital`
